<title>USA: Tosco surges 13 pct on Unocal pact.</title>
<headline>Tosco surges 13 pct on Unocal pact.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tosco Corp shares surged 13 percent after the company agreed to buy all the operating assets of Unocal Corp's 76 Products Co, the refining and marketing businesses on the West Coast which Unocal recently put on the auction block.</p>
<p>Tosco rose 7-5/8 points to 67-3/4 while Unocal added 5/8 to 40-1/8.  </p>
<p>Tosco said it would pay $1.4 billion and assume limited environmental liabilities.</p>
</text>
